{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105260/extras/50adb188cd9158b5d25380e8b9865460.avif?t=1769454761\" width=1280 height=256 /></span>\ud83d\udd25 Pizza Kidd is now crowdfunding on <strong>Kickstarter</strong>!<br>Help us finish the full game and bring the Pizza Kidd universe to life... here on STEAM (Early Access)!  <br>   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105260/extras/4d559344b99b7052e2d0dd7e7bf9a691.avif?t=1769454761\" alt=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/pizzakidd/pizza-kidd-2d-pixel-punchfest-with-monsters-and-mayhem\" width=1024 height=576 /></span>\ud83d\udc49 Back the project today \u2014 January 6th through February 8th, 2026!  <br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105260/extras/102cd46626117cbb36bdc0f23c3bc808.poster.avif?t=1769454761\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105260/extras/102cd46626117cbb36bdc0f23c3bc808.webm?t=1769454761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105260/extras/102cd46626117cbb36bdc0f23c3bc808.mp4?t=1769454761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world on the brink of destruction, one unlikely hero steps forward. KIDD, a young martial artist as swift with punches and kicks as he is with delivering your pizza, is humanity\u2019s last hope. <i>Pizza Kidd</i> pulses with the spirit and edginess of 90's anime and the grit of classic arcade brawlers of the same era, blending beautifully detailed 16-bit pixel art with fast-paced, responsive combat. This isn\u2019t just another &quot;indie&quot; game\u2014it\u2019s an electrifying homage to a golden era, crafted with love and modern flair to keep things feeling fresh yet familiar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105260/extras/eeca12a976a72bede2792896f464ac0c.webp?t=1769454761\" width=612 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Santos, the sinister architect behind the city's destruction, now commands an army of nightmares: creepy creature clones, zombified scarecrow ninjas that strike without warning, drone bots that patrol the gates, and towering monstrous behemoths that crush everything in their path. The streets are crawling with terror, but KIDD\u2019s mission is clear\u2014recover the 8 sacred seed stones, harness their power, and put an end to Santos' reign of madness. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105260/extras/4a8c3c396ae89b82a39b0195e0b7c2a9.poster.avif?t=1769454761\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105260/extras/4a8c3c396ae89b82a39b0195e0b7c2a9.webm?t=1769454761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105260/extras/4a8c3c396ae89b82a39b0195e0b7c2a9.mp4?t=1769454761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105260/extras/b3102a697464aa62419e75326008640f.poster.avif?t=1769454761\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105260/extras/b3102a697464aa62419e75326008640f.webm?t=1769454761\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105260/extras/b3102a697464aa62419e75326008640f.mp4?t=1769454761\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105260/extras/1d9a86d2217ba391e2de5d504869155f.webp?t=1769454761\" width=612 height=40 /></span><strong> </strong><br><strong>Unleash the Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>High-Impact Combat</strong>: Fast, responsive attacks, air juggling, and long chain combos for intense expressive gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Side-Scrolling Adventure</strong>: Expansive 2D levels with skill-based, fighting-style special moves. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Retro Pixel Brilliance</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Vivid 16-Bit Art</strong>: Hand-drawn / animated, comic noir pixel art with detailed stages, big character sprites, and explosive effects. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sound that Hits Hard</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Crunchy Arcade Sound Design</strong>: Satisfying hits with every punch and kick!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 <strong>Energized Soundtrack</strong>: Original music<strong>\u00a0</strong>that amplifies the energy and action \u2014 with original compositions by Kevin Ripley, Martin Lande, Yanni Ziangos, Silent Sphere, Dj Spinna, Byron the Aquarius, Rashad &quot;Tumblin' Dice&quot; Smith, Lisa Bella Donna, and other guests musicians.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2105260/extras/321ee1837572f3d66924692ef8194605.webp?t=1769454761\" width=612 height=40 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_p